{"reviews":[{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-0","r":4.0,"t":"It works!!!","x":"It worked really well. It\u2019s big enough to put both hands in at the same time. It fully dries your nail fast. You can set a time to dry your nails or just stick your hands in and the lights come on.  You can also use this one to dry your toenails. Haven\u2019t used that function yet. I would recommend it.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-1","r":5.0,"t":"Did the job as expected","x":"I used this to put on my first set of polygel nails.  It was super easy to use and did the job as I expected it would.  The auto function was extremely handy, as was the ability to time it if I wanted.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-2","r":5.0,"t":"Great product!!!","x":"It works awesome! It even has the sensor so when you put your hand on the black part it goes on!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-3","r":5.0,"t":"Good investment","x":"Great pruchase , item works very fast and i am able to complete my work faster","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-4","r":1.0,"t":"Bad product for business","x":"Does not cure gel polish at all only makes nails sticky","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-5","r":5.0,"t":"Worked Perfectly","x":"This UV Nail Lamp allowed me to do my own gel nails at home, keeping me safe from COVID-19 exposure and allows me to save some money.  It's lightweight, modern and works perfectly well.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-6","r":5.0,"t":"Love this machine!","x":"This a great machine! Love it and a fraction of the price of the more expensive ones.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-7","r":1.0,"t":"BAD UNIT & BAD SELLER!!! BEWARE!","x":"My unit ended up being a lemon. 3 days after the return to Amazon date expired, the plug on the unit ended up breaking and falling inside the unit.  I could not return to Amazon as the return period expired so I reached out to the seller and their only advice to me was contact Amazon.  Too much of a hassle dealing with this seller. I would not recommend this product or seller, you may end up wasting money and they don't seem to care.  I believe the unit may be a good one, and I just received a b","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-8","r":1.0,"t":"Thanks, I hate it.","x":"At first, the lamp was great. But then a couple months went by and it started lagging on curing. I noticed the lights weren\u2019t adjusting properly for the time & I haven\u2019t gotten it to work properly since.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-9","r":3.0,"t":"Waste of money","x":"You get what you pay for. Spend a little more money. This took forever to dry my nails. It fell apart the second time i used it.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-10","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing lamp!","x":"This lamp is amazing! Worth every cent and then some! The light isn't harmful or too bright , it dries quickly, the display is handy for me and my clients. It does not recharge or is wireless like the box says but I'm ok with that.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-11","r":1.0,"t":"Disappointed","x":"Purchased this based off really good reviews. Disappointed. No matter how long I leave nails under the unit, the appropriate gel polish does not cure. Looking for one that works.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-12","r":1.0,"t":"Cheap","x":"Keeps turning on nd off some lights turn on some don\u2019t very disappointing sometimes they dim I want a replacement please contact me I will send defective one back","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-13","r":1.0,"t":"It\u2019s really bad","x":"It\u2019s really bad I had one and got broken within 2 weeks then recently got another one it was or easy damaged I will never get it again","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-14","r":1.0,"t":"Doesn\u2019t last!","x":"It stopped working. It was working fine but it stopped and idk why.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-15","r":2.0,"t":"Doesn\u2019t Charge","x":"Well where do I start......first this is supposed to be a \u201ccharging\u201d UV LED light.  It doesn\u2019t charge , you have to plug it in for it to work and second, the instructions are very poorly written and I don\u2019t know what \u201cnon-hamful\u201d to eyes means.  Did they mean non-harmful? I feel like I just bought this off of Wish and not Amazon \ud83d\ude12","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-16","r":4.0,"t":"Yes  and ok","x":"I love it  but The directions says if you charge it for two hours it could become wireless mine doesn\u2019t do that if you\u2019re looking for a wireless one up in your pricing but overall it works","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-17","r":1.0,"t":"Cheap garbage","x":"Garbage. Plugged it in... It worked for 60 seconds... Had a horrible burning smell and then stopped turning on. It's not rechargeable either .. returning and going with another brand.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-18","r":1.0,"t":"Not to great after all","x":"Worked great at first. Not even two months with it and lights are not functioning properly. I don\u2019t move it around, I keep it in a specific spot all times.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-19","r":1.0,"t":"Waste of money.","x":"I received this item on August 20, 2020 and by November 30 it was no longer working. Don\u2019t waste your money.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-20","r":1.0,"t":"Waste of money","x":"No Good. Powers on and off. Not rechargeable at all.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-21","r":5.0,"t":"Great for a gift","x":"I liked it, it wasn't to bulky to put on the table.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-22","r":1.0,"t":"Seller doesn\u2019t respond so apparently they don\u2019t stand behind their \u201cwarranty\u201d","x":"Very disappointed. When I first got it I loved it. It is easy to use BUT\u2026.. After 10 months it just stopped working and right in the middle of my manicure.  I was in the middle of one hand, hadn\u2019t even started on the other and I had to take the gummy gel nail polish off (what a mess) and fix my nails to put regular polish on until I figured out if I was going to get a refund or a new product from the seller. I\u2019ve tried several times to reach out to the seller with no response. It has a one year ","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-23","r":1.0,"t":"Horrible Customer Service","x":"Beware!! I bought this lamp in November of 2020. I didn't start to actually use it till February of 2021. A couple of weeks after using this lamp it completely stops working. I tried contacting the company that sold it to me and they were absolutely no help. They didn't even bother to respond, so if you do purchase this lamp make sure to check to see if it works if you don't want to waste your money","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B07J2BW1KH-24","r":1.0,"t":"Power flickers on and off and sometimes doesn\u2019t even turn on.","x":"After using the product for only three weeks, power constantly flickers on and off and often requires troubleshooting to even get it to turn on in the first place. May just be a faulty piece of equipment, but I no longer have the original packaging, despite still being within the return window, and therefore cannot replace it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many customers say the lamp works well and dries nails quickly, with handy auto/sensor and timer functions.","cites":[1,2,3,4,6,11]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the lamp fails to properly cure gel polish, leaving nails sticky or uncured.","cites":[5,9,12]},{"text":"Some customers report durability problems, with units breaking or stopping working within weeks or months.","cites":[8,10,13,14,15]},{"text":"Reviewers consider it good value for the price compared to more expensive lamps.","cites":[6,7,11]},{"text":"A few customers complain it is slow to dry nails or that the lights malfunction.","cites":[10,13]}]},"qa":[]}